; Hotkey Vault config example
; Copy this file to snippets.ini next to PassVault.ahk (or the compiled exe).
; Never commit a real snippets.ini.
;
; Master.Verifier is SHA-256 of the session master passphrase plus an app salt.
; It does not store the passphrase. Snippet Data is ciphertext only.

[Master]
Verifier=
